@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 65
skinparam ranksep 70
title 001 Guided Notes - Component Diagram (Merged Headers / Main Questions and Subitems)
component "Teacher Workspace" as UI
component "Teacher Authorization\n(adjacent module)" as Auth
component "Activity Module\nended state / bound import" as Activity
component "002 Course Ownership Provider\nget_owned_course" as Courses
component "Result Module\nversioned winning answers" as Results
package "Guided Notes Feature" {
 component "Import and Recognition\nHeaders, merged ranges / subitems" as Import
 component "Confirmed Catalog\nand Source Bindings" as Catalog
 component "Export Preview, Write-back\nand Read-back Recovery" as Export
 component "Source Access" as Access
 component "Operation Repository\nand Source Lease" as Store
}
cloud "Original Google Sheets" as Sheets
UI --> Import : select / preview / confirm
note left of UI
Import one selected worksheet at a time.
Use its source title or a custom lecture label.
No source rename is performed.
end note
UI --> Export : preview / confirm / report
Import --> Auth : authorize
Import --> Courses : verify course context before Google and publication
Catalog --> Courses : authorize scoped lecture list / exact version
Export --> Auth : authorize and recheck
Import --> Catalog : publish versioned mapping
Catalog --> Activity : versioned main questions and items
Export --> Catalog : resolve target bindings
Import --> Store : persist confirmed version
Export --> Store : claim / persist / release
Export --> Activity : validate binding and ended state
Export --> Results : obtain and recheck result version
Import --> Access : read source
Export --> Access : inspect / write / read back
Access --> Sheets : authorized source operations
note left of Access
Desktop OAuth helper is CLI-only for consent.
Normal calls load/refresh credentials before writing.
SDK transport has no automatic write replay.
end note
note bottom of Catalog
Activity receives main questions and ordered subitems.
Source positions stay in this feature.
end note
note bottom of Export
Executor: writeback.py uses export_service pure core.
DB lease plus process mutex key the physical spreadsheet / sheet.
Unresolved attempts block unrelated writes until recovery.
Read-only preview stores provider snapshot and source observations.
GET displays saved observations without network or writes.
Changed source invalidates preview.
Only read-back matches are successful.
A merged main number defines one unit and winner.
No winner is skipped; confirm conflicts.
end note
@enduml
